# Test updating issue type

This test verifies that the `convert` command correctly updates an issue's type and renames the file.

```console
$ PEBBLES_DB_PATH=.pebbles pebbles show 12345678
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
ID: 12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012
Title: Test Issue
Type: Bug
Status: TODO
Description: A test issue for trycmd validation

